ets that fight with incoming enemies.  <br>You can research 15 types of turrets that belong to five categories (archery, natural, guns, throwing, splash). Every turret has physical damage, advanced turrets adds elemental damage bonus (fire, poison, ice) and special attack feature. Elemental damage rise overtime damage or slowing monsters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also you can unlock heroes (depends on your progress) that helps you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409890/extras/c98d17aa79f036413e9f4d2fe3f76b90.poster.avif?t=1773481120\" width=1170 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409890/extras/c98d17aa79f036413e9f4d2fe3f76b90.webm?t=1773481120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409890/extras/c98d17aa79f036413e9f4d2fe3f76b90.mp4?t=1773481120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies incoming from four bioms. The <strong>Valley</strong> is nearest and enemies haven`t any armor. <strong>Mountains</strong>, <strong>Desert</strong> and <strong>Swamp</strong>\u00a0monsters has<strong> </strong>armor with resistances to specific elemental attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies are in several classes : normal, special, boss and special chapter enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409890/extras/5f38cc7bacd9f718aa56f1002ae1c12d.poster.avif?t=1773481120\" width=1170 height=72 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409890/extras/5f38cc7bacd9f718aa56f1002ae1c12d.webm?t=1773481120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://